{"3300030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Guinea Pig Z", "steam_appid": 3300030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>A SMALL TOWN TORN APART</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highly infectious virus has overtaken the small town of Misolli, Washington. Transforming its residents into ravenous flesh eating undead. Only a handful of survivors remain, left to fend for themselves. But the infection didn’t stop at humans. Guinea pigs, exposed within their owners’ homes, mutated in a very different way, growing into large, intelligent battle beasts. Now, they fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>FAST PACED AND EASY TO PICK UP GAMEPLAY</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether rescuing survivors, fighting undead, or managing your base. GPZ keeps things simple, most in game actions are linked to only a simple left mouse click. You have 7 days to prepare, get moving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300030/extras/debdecbb5717f64324a7ebb202a28a0e.poster.avif?t=1788237733\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300030/extras/debdecbb5717f64324a7ebb202a28a0e.webm?t=1788237733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300030/extras/debdecbb5717f64324a7ebb202a28a0e.mp4?t=1788237733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>HURRY BEFORE IT GETS DARK</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300030/extras/6c478d2b0456413db142b